		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Born from the violent death of a mortal capable of magic, seeks to torment and absorb spell-casters' minds.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 27, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +6 (2d6 + mind drain), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mind Drain</strong>. 1d4 INT damage. Death if reduced to 0 INT, caller absorbs intellect if mortal, gaining memories.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunlight Weakness</strong>. Cannot take actions in direct sunlight, only move.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
